==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[fara]]'' (meaning "to [[go]]") + ''[[af]]'' (meaning "[[off]]") + ''[[stað]]'', the dative singular of ''[[staður]]'' (meaning "[[place]]"). Literally meaning "to go off place".

===Verb===
{{is-verb}}

# to [[depart]], to [[leave]]

====Conjugation====
See [[fara]].

